    "message": "Updated comparison to work with Biostrings 2.79.3\n\ncomparable_seqtypes was changed in Biostrings to allow for seqtypes \"ModRNA\" and \"ModDNA\" to be used efficiently. Performance improvements by avoiding the constructor calls as suggested by Herve Pages were implemented.\n",
